From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] presence: stop after a failed Activity join

Do not continue through partially initialized channel state after reporting a
join failure. The failed command has no usable text channel and must remain a
clean negative result for callers.

--- a/src/sugar4/presence/activity.py
+++ b/src/sugar4/presence/activity.py
@@ -305,6 +305,7 @@
         _logger.debug("%r: Join finished %r" % (self, error))
         if error is not None:
             self.emit("joined", error is None, str(error))
+            return
         self.telepathy_text_chan = join_command.text_channel
         self.telepathy_tubes_chan = join_command.tubes_channel
         self._channel_self_handle = join_command.channel_self_handle
